    <div x-data="faqAccordion()" class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="faq-item bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl">
          <div @click="toggle(0)" class="faq-question flex justify-between items-center p-8 cursor-pointer">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">What is a natal chart?</h3>
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 transform transition-transform duration-200" :class="{ 'rotate-180': openIndex === 0 }" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div x-show="openIndex === 0" x-transition class="faq-answer px-8 pb-8">
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-lg">
              A natal chart, also known as a birth chart, is a map of the sky at the exact moment and location of your birth. 
              It shows the positions of the Sun, Moon, and planets in the zodiac signs and houses, which astrologers use to 
              understand your personality, strengths, challenges, and life path.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl">
          <div @click="toggle(1)" class="faq-question flex justify-between items-center p-8 cursor-pointer">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">How accurate are your calculations?</h3>
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 transform transition-transform duration-200" :class="{ 'rotate-180': openIndex === 1 }" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div x-show="openIndex === 1" x-transition class="faq-answer px-8 pb-8">
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-lg">
              Our calculations use the Swiss Ephemeris, one of the most accurate astronomical algorithms available. 
              We account for precession, nutation, and other astronomical factors to provide precise planetary positions. 
              For the most accurate chart, we recommend using your exact birth time and location.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl">
          <div @click="toggle(2)" class="faq-question flex justify-between items-center p-8 cursor-pointer">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Is astrology scientifically proven?</h3>
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 transform transition-transform duration-200" :class="{ 'rotate-180': openIndex === 2 }" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div x-show="openIndex === 2" x-transition class="faq-answer px-8 pb-8">
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-lg">
              Astrology is not considered a science by the scientific community, as it doesn't follow the scientific method 
              and its predictions haven't been consistently validated through controlled studies. However, many people find 
              value in astrology as a tool for self-reflection, understanding patterns, and gaining insights into their 
              personality and relationships.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    function faqAccordion() {
      return {
        openIndex: null,
        toggle(index) {
          if (this.openIndex === index) {
            this.openIndex = null;
          } else {
            this.openIndex = index;
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>

